{
    "title": "Babysense Smart Nursery",
    "description": "A smart way to monitor and keep your baby safe - Babysense Baby Smart Nursery Monitoring solution provides a modular eco-system allowing you to track breathing movements & sleep patterns, capture priceless moments and develop healthy sleep habits for the entire family.\r\n\r\nTransform Your Phone Into a Smart Baby Monitor\r\n- Monitor and capture your baby's priceless moments anytime from anywhere\r\n- Monitor every movement and irregular sleeping patterns\r\n- Promotes healthy sleep habits and quality sleep for the entire family\r\n\r\n* Babysense Connect - Smart Baby Movement Monitor\r\nStay connected to your baby's well-being with our advanced contact-free movement monitor. Track every baby's movement in real-time, ensuring your little one's safety and comfort, all from your smartphone.\r\nBabysense Connect records your baby's movements and sending real-time data straight to your smartphone. Now, even when you're not in the room, you'll always be attuned to your little one's well-being.\r\n\r\n\r\n* Babysense SEE+ - Smart WiFi HD Camera\r\nCapture life's precious moments with our WiFi HD Camera. From first smiles to playful crawls, see it all in clear HD. With advanced IR night vision and app integration, you're connected anytime, anywhere.\r\nFull HD 1080p, Captue and Record,\r\nPan/Tilt/Zoom, Detect & Track Motion,\r\nNight Vision, Two Way Talk-Back,\r\nMultiple users,\r\nSplit screen\r\n\r\n* Babysense Dreamer - Smart Sound & Light Machine\r\nEnhance bedtime with our Smart Sound and Light Machine. Customizable soundscapes, ambient lighting and schedules cteate the ideal sleep environment for your baby, all easily controlled from your device.\r\n16 Million RGB colors, Customizable favorite ambiances, Manual & App activation, 4 rich sound categories, Program Schedules, Portable and compact, Backlit touch buttons, Temperature & time display",
    "descriptionHTML": "A smart way to monitor and keep your baby safe - Babysense Baby Smart Nursery Monitoring solution provides a modular eco-system allowing you to track breathing movements &amp; sleep patterns, capture priceless moments and develop healthy sleep habits for the entire family.<br><br>Transform Your Phone Into a Smart Baby Monitor<br>- Monitor and capture your baby&#39;s priceless moments anytime from anywhere<br>- Monitor every movement and irregular sleeping patterns<br>- Promotes healthy sleep habits and quality sleep for the entire family<br><br>* Babysense Connect - Smart Baby Movement Monitor<br>Stay connected to your baby&#39;s well-being with our advanced contact-free movement monitor. Track every baby&#39;s movement in real-time, ensuring your little one&#39;s safety and comfort, all from your smartphone.<br>Babysense Connect records your baby&#39;s movements and sending real-time data straight to your smartphone. Now, even when you&#39;re not in the room, you&#39;ll always be attuned to your little one&#39;s well-being.<br><br><br>* Babysense SEE+ - Smart WiFi HD Camera<br>Capture life&#39;s precious moments with our WiFi HD Camera. From first smiles to playful crawls, see it all in clear HD. With advanced IR night vision and app integration, you&#39;re connected anytime, anywhere.<br>Full HD 1080p, Captue and Record,<br>Pan/Tilt/Zoom, Detect &amp; Track Motion,<br>Night Vision, Two Way Talk-Back,<br>Multiple users,<br>Split screen<br><br>* Babysense Dreamer - Smart Sound &amp; Light Machine<br>Enhance bedtime with our Smart Sound and Light Machine. Customizable soundscapes, ambient lighting and schedules cteate the ideal sleep environment for your baby, all easily controlled from your device.<br>16 Million RGB colors, Customizable favorite ambiances, Manual &amp; App activation, 4 rich sound categories, Program Schedules, Portable and compact, Backlit touch buttons, Temperature &amp; time display",
